<title>USA: Republic Group Inc Q1 Sept 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Republic Group Inc Q1 Sept 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Kan. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $29,004,000    $32,272,000</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	7,915,000	5,100,000</p>
